  "Kaidai KD3 Class: Pearl Harbor (+2 Tránsitos [1 ida / 1 vuelta]) [Base Yokosuka]": "Kaidai KD3 Class: Pearl Harbor (+2 Transits [1 Outbound / 1 Inbound]) [Base Yokosuka]",
